format: 2
name: a user record Value reaches the ledger handler by simple name
class: Probe
method: m
arg: 05
expect: REJECT JULC0055
note: ADR-067 F45: nested in Probe, on the constructor. A subset rule: a class or a record does not take a type key of the lowering.
note: ADR-068 M6: on the only frontend, javac, REJECT JULC0055; the JavaParser frontend answered REJECT JULC0100.
---
import java.math.BigInteger;

public class Probe {
    record Value(boolean isEmpty) {}

    public static boolean m(BigInteger a) {
        return new Value(a.signum() > 0).isEmpty();
    }
}
